I've postponed my much longer flame on the Lojbab missives, because I
doubt it would be constructive.

A flame, however (meant kindly and sympathetically, of course), to Aulun
on the "National Anthem". The song has nothing to do with the "Let's make
up a country" thing Pierre has been doing, which I also don't want to have
anything to do with. Its genesis was triggered by the Esperanto Hymn
[Anthem], and should be rather be classed in the same rubric as the Lojban
Logo; it is intended to be emblematic, without being fantastical.

